            </note>
            <note corresp="#d820-f2" n="6" xml:id="d820-f2-content">
                <p>Senator Tom Connally, Chairman of the Senate Foreign Relations Committee.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d820-f3" n="7" xml:id="d820-f3-content">
                <p>Representative Sam Rayburn, Speaker of the House of Representatives.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d820-f4" n="8" xml:id="d820-f4-content">
                <p>Representative John W. McCormack, Majority Leader of the House of
                    Representatives.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d820-f5" n="9" xml:id="d820-f5-content">
